<title>GERMANY: Vereinsbank raises BHF to market neutral. [corrected 10:50 gmt]</title>
<headline>Vereinsbank raises BHF to market neutral. [corrected 10:50 gmt]</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects level of rating in headline.)</p>
<p>Germany's Vereinsbank Research on Wednesday said it had raised its rating for BHF Bank AG to 'market neutral' from 'underperform'.</p>
<p>At the same time, the research arm of Bayerische Vereinsbank AG said it had cut Metallgesellschaft AG to market neutral from above average.</p>
</text>
